      "value": "If you don't like to socialize, the why do you care about having a ranking at all? The ranking is about trust, not about been famous, there are hackers who upload many avatars or steal them and upload very meh worlds, I wouldn't trust some just for that, but if some people know then is the best way to know how trust worthy is someone, \"oh yes I know him it's has been my friend for a long time and I have see them making avatars etc\".",
      "viewerReactions": null
